refugees  into an old shipping container  inside was a toilet bedding and enough  supplies to last 10 days  unfortunately before they were able to  get everyone safely inside  they were spotted almost immediately a  number of alarms and sirens began to  echo throughout the port  and robotic security forces called  rangers  suddenly appeared and began advancing  towards them  casper wasting no time rapidly took them  down using his rifle  escaping back onto their vessel the  copper field slowly departed from the  dock  while rao hacked into the automated  distribution system and proceeded to  drop containers wherever he could in an  attempt to block the pursuing vessels  the singaporean port authority followed  them out into the open waters  with the sound of gunfire and battle  cries coming from behind them  their foes seemed to be catching up on  them  suddenly there was a dead silence  but then this ended abruptly and an  enormous booming sound from a cannon  being fired was heard  kavan and the others braced for impact  yet almost immediately he realized that  the sound didn't come from behind them  out in front of the copper field on the  horizon they see a huge number of  fishing trawlers  container ships tug boats and much much  more  it's a no-pat fleet the singaporean port  authority is now vastly outnumbered  and immediately they call off the chase  and head back towards the coast  the copperfield has been floating around  somewhere in the yellow sea for the last  two days  waiting on orders from higher up  specialist webster mckay tells kavan  that oz generally only provides just  enough intel to keep the operations  moving  he sends this out via telegraph with  only basic points  so only those intended to receive these  messages would be able to understand  them  kevin has been passing the time by  keeping up to date following the steady  stream of news being broadcasted around  the globe  as it turns out there was one story in  particular that would soon involve the  copperfield and its crew  [Music]  the news report talks of an incident at  daesong electronics  korea is one of the few success stories  of the last decade  their economy wasn't just surviving it  was growing  and one of the companies that can be  credited with the bulk of the success  is daisong electronics  before the blackout in 2040 that dropped  earth back into the dark ages  most of the world had switched over to  satellite internet  this earthbound internet service  provider came up with a solution that  would get the world back online  without the need to roll out expensive  hardware across the planet  this isp was called k-net  by 2041 daesong had 60 of all internet  traffic  running through its servers which in  turn flowed through to the quantum data  center  in the middle of song do naturally the  sheer volume of information going  through this data center  would provide a significant tactical  advantage for those who were able to get  their hands on it  so us and russian intelligence networks  keep a very close eye on what's  happening here  at around 7 30 a.m an executive  assistant  at daesong electronics made out with 10  terabytes of internal data  from the headquarters in seongdu south  korea and escaped on a stolen corporate  helicopter  the identity behind this was an  unexpected korean woman in her twenties  immediately it was assumed that she was  a foreign intelligence asset  from one of the two main superpower  countries the us  or russia but what they didn't realize  is that there was a third faction who  was interested in this intel war  after kavan finished with the news he  headed up above deck  while looking over the horizon he  noticed something approaching in the  distance  it was a black helicopter and on the  side was the daesong logo  the entire crew has now assembled on the  side of the ship  suddenly the helicopter appears to lose  control and eventually crashes down in  the distance  caven looks around at the crew but no  one seems to be particularly concerned  about this  and a minute later it would all make  sense  above the ship there was a woman  parachuting down  it was the korean woman who had made off  with the intel from daesong  electronics after she landed  on the deck casper and rau quickly  escort her inside  she is known as specialist j sue pake a  non-pat  agent put in place by oz who's been  working undercover  at daesong  reflects back on his time over the  months with his crew of no pets  the government had led everyone to  believe that they were the enemy  but after singapore he was convinced  that they were the sympathetic underdogs  making the hard choices to help the  struggling survive  but now he was witnessing them  infiltrate international tech giants  beating the global superpowers at their  own game  perhaps there is far more to this group  of nationless soldiers that we've been  led to believe  [Music]  [Music]  you

